        "created_at": "2013-04-25T19:29:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is a great mystery! At least I don't think it has been said which timeline it goes down. Infact it could be the end result of all time-lines as it is so distant into the future. The only timeline I know for sure is it is a timeline where Chrono-Ranger fails, unless Chrono-Ranger is doing something that will end the same no matter what.</p>",
